  "sourceAssignment": "Completion 165 Ultimate Maze exclusively owns ultimate-maze-part1 through part7, seven full chronological original families. The final part7 starts with the VIP menu exit and Maze navigation, allocated only here; no VIP part5 exists. All35 original/sidecar files and earlier failed transformations, two whole-board destructions, seven undos and final win remain. No unrelated level or hunt footage is reassigned.",
  "scope": "Literal IS is controlled by LONELY TEXT IS YOU. Earlier hedge transformations destroy the board and are undone. The final visit transports an original OPEN key through one SHUT wall, reuses the other key to transport WIN, then converts the remaining29 walls to keys while keeping the hedges intact. Moving IS onto the former WIN tile loses control; the recorded correction preserves a key buffer and forms FLAG IS WIN. The22-direction return matches its checkpoints. Two final DOWNs put a key onto and then beyond the flag; IS/flag overlap triggers victory. Settled map pause confirms165/nine; precise internal control/win processing order was not independently isolated.",
